 Column |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default | Storage  | Description 
--------+---------+-----------+----------+---------+----------+-------------
 f1     | integer |           |          |         | plain    | 
 f2     | integer |           |          |         | plain    | 
 f3     | text    |           |          |         | extended | 
View definition:
 SELECT f1,
    f2,
    f3
   FROM a2
  WHERE (EXISTS ( SELECT 1
           FROM tt1 a2_1
          WHERE a2.f1 = a2_1.x1));

